              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "لکھوانا — likhvānā — \"to have written down; to dictate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "گواہ نے اپنا بیان لکھوایا۔ gavāh ne apnā bayān likhvāyā. The witness had his statement written down."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with نے (he or she …): اس نے رپورٹ لکھوائی, us ne riporṭ likhvāī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "لکھوانا (likhvānā) is the second causing form of لکھنا, to write, which CDIAL lists under Sanskrit likháti, \"scratches, writes\" (CDIAL 11048). The ending -vā- hands the writing to someone else."
            }
          ]
        },
